TASK: BUILD THE OX-DX COMMUNICATION & MESSAGING SYSTEM

Repository:

https://github.com/bjo163/universal-ontology-engine

Brand:

# OX-DX

Descriptor:

**Universal Ontology & Experience Engine**

Technical implementation:

**Universal Ontology Engine**

Primary tagline:

**FROM STRUCTURE TO EXPERIENCE.**

Secondary:

**FROM UNIVERSE TO BIT.**

Core principle:

**EVIDENCE FIRST.**

Core attitude:

**DON'T FORCE THE SHAPE.**

Core method:

**OBSERVE. RESOLVE. UNDERSTAND.**

# ============================================================ 0. PURPOSE

Create the canonical communication system for OX-DX.

This is NOT a logo task.

This is NOT a website task.

This is NOT a code task.

This task defines how OX-DX speaks, explains itself, names things, describes its technology, writes documentation, writes GitHub content, announces releases, and communicates with developers.

The objective:

Every public surface should sound like the same project.

README
GitHub
Documentation
Issues
Pull Requests
Releases
Website
Future UI
CLI messaging
Social posts
Technical papers
Community

must share one communication language.

\============================================================

1. FIRST — INSPECT
   \============================================================

Before writing anything, inspect:

README.md

assets/

assets/ASSET\_INDEX.md

assets/documentation/

especially:

brand-manifesto.md
brand-voice.md
brand-guidelines.md
