current release/version information

Use repository truth.

Do not invent technical terminology that conflicts with the implementation.

# ============================================================ 2. COMMUNICATION PHILOSOPHY

OX-DX communication must combine:

**QURANIC DEPTH**
\+
**GEN-Z CLARITY**
\+
**GRUNGE ATTITUDE**
\+
**INTELLIGENT PRECISION**

Desired feeling:

Ancient questions.
Modern machines.
Raw engineering.
Precise thought.

The voice should feel:

calm
deep
direct
sharp
slightly mysterious
technically disciplined

It should NOT feel:

corporate
academic-heavy
religiously preachy
startup-hype
generic-AI
overwritten
pretentious

# ============================================================ 3. THE OX-DX WORLDVIEW

Create:

`assets/documentation/communication/worldview.md`

Explain the fundamental worldview of the project.

Build around:

Systems leave traces.

Evidence can be observed.

Observed evidence can be described.

Descriptions need a vocabulary.

Relationships need a graph.

Representation changes.

Provenance matters.

Resolution has boundaries.

The system should not pretend to know what the evidence does not support.

Use this conceptual progression:

```
SEE
  ↓
OBSERVE
  ↓
DESCRIBE
  ↓
CONNECT
  ↓
RESOLVE
  ↓
EXPERIENCE

```

Do not present this as an implemented algorithm unless repository evidence supports it.

It is communication philosophy.

# ============================================================ 4. BRAND STORY

Create:

`assets/documentation/communication/brand-story.md`

Write the canonical OX-DX story.

Narrative direction:

Reality is complicated.

Software is complicated.

Systems leave evidence.

Different systems expose different structures.

OX-DX provides a common resolution vocabulary without forcing those systems into artificial shapes.

It starts with what can be observed.

It preserves native evidence.

It connects relationships.

It separates structure from observation.

It preserves provenance.

It progressively resolves representation.

From structure to experience.

From universe to bit.

Write this as a compelling story.

Do not copy these instructions verbatim.

# ============================================================ 5. MESSAGING HIERARCHY

Create:

`assets/documentation/communication/messaging-framework.md`

Define four layers.

LEVEL 1 — ONE-LINE

What is OX-DX?

Example direction:

"OX-DX is a Universal Ontology & Experience Engine for resolving heterogeneous evidence from structure to representation."

Create the strongest technically accurate version.

LEVEL 2 — SHORT

2–3 sentences explaining the product.

LEVEL 3 — STANDARD

One short paragraph explaining:

ontology
graph
evidence
observation
provenance
resolution

LEVEL 4 — DEEP

A technical explanation pointing users toward:

specification
architecture
implementation
CLI
GitHub

Every public communication should fit one of these levels.

